{"ticker":"ED","updated":"2026-10-30T22:46:08Z","profile":{"longName":"Consolidated Edison, Inc.","shortName":"Consolidated Edison, Inc.","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","country":"United States","website":"https://www.conedison.com","fullTimeEmployees":15407,"marketCap":43136811008,"trailingPE":19.215815,"forwardPE":17.959175,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.4386234,"pegRatio":2.28,"targetMeanPrice":107.38235,"targetHighPrice":130.0,"targetLowPrice":87.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":17,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.132,"earningsGrowth":0.221,"grossMargins":0.53372,"operatingMargins":0.16540001,"profitMargins":0.12533,"totalRevenue":17688999936,"beta":0.25,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":117.65,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":94.96,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.07},"summary":"Consolidated Edison, Inc., through its subsidiaries, engages in the regulated electric, gas, and steam delivery businesses in the United States. The company offers electric services to approximately 3.7 million customers in New York City and Westchester County; gas to approximately 1.1 million customers in Manhattan, the Bronx, parts of Queens, and Westchester County; and steam to approximately 1,490 customers in parts of Manhattan. It also supplies electricity to approximately 0.3 million customers in southeastern New York and northern New Jersey; and gas to approximately 0.1 million customers in southeastern New York. In addition, the company operates 552 circuit miles of transmission lines; 16 transmission substations; 63 distribution substations; 89,675 in-service line transformers; 3,764 pole miles of overhead distribution lines; and 2,417 miles of underground distribution lines, as well as 4,374 miles of mains and 379, 939 service lines for natural gas distribution. Further, it invests in electric and gas transmission projects. The company primarily sells electricity to industrial, commercial, residential, and government customers. Consolidated Edison, Inc. was founded in 1823 and is based in New York, New York.","summary_zh":"Consolidated Edison, Inc. 透過其子公司在美國從事受監管的電力、燃氣和蒸汽輸送業務。該公司為紐約市和威徹斯特縣約 370 萬客戶提供電力服務；為曼哈頓、布朗克斯、皇后區部分地區和威徹斯特縣約 110 萬客戶提供天然氣；並為曼哈頓部分地區的約 1,490 名客戶提供服務。它還為紐約州東南部和新澤西州北部的約 30 萬名客戶提供電力；和天然氣為紐約州東南部約 10 萬名客戶提供服務。此外，該公司還運營 552 英里的輸電線路； 16座輸變電所； 63個配電變電站；89,675 台在役線路變壓器； 3,764 桿英里的架空配電線路；和 2,417 英里的地下分配線路，以及 4,374 英里的總管道和 399 條管道和 939 條線路和 939 3939。此外，它還投資電力和天然氣輸送項目。該公司主要向工業、商業、住宅和政府客戶出售電力。 Consolidated Edison, Inc. 成立於 1823 年，總部位於紐約州紐約市。","sector_zh":"公用事業","industry_zh":"公用事業 - 受監管的電力","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":98.29,"h":98.29,"l":96.55,"c":97.2,"v":3019300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":96.95,"h":97.89,"l":96.61,"c":97.85,"v":4306700},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":98.6,"h":98.81,"l":97.35,"c":97.8,"v":2033300},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":97.97,"h":98.31,"l":97.35,"c":98.05,"v":1724500},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":97.91,"h":98.15,"l":96.22,"c":96.65,"v":2189400},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":96.28,"h":97.35,"l":96.15,"c":96.98,"v":1282700},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":97.07,"h":97.34,"l":96.46,"c":97.08,"v":1603600},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":96.97,"h":97.78,"l":96.51,"c":97.7,"v":1690000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":97.57,"h":98.56,"l":97.1,"c":97.55,"v":1249400},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":97.6,"h":97.63,"l":96.79,"c":97.0,"v":1351900},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":96.51,"h":96.88,"l":95.26,"c":95.57,"v":2116600},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":96.29,"h":97.3,"l":96.15,"c":96.4,"v":1879800},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":95.74,"h":96.91,"l":95.69,"c":96.35,"v":1815600},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":96.54,"h":96.91,"l":95.9,"c":96.33,"v":4091700},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":96.38,"h":96.95,"l":95.97,"c":96.62,"v":1939000},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":96.36,"h":98.64,"l":96.3,"c":98.55,"v":2204300},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":98.29,"h":99.27,"l":98.29,"c":98.81,"v":1611600},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":99.5,"h":99.85,"l":98.23,"c":98.35,"v":1848500},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":98.74,"h":99.92,"l":98.19,"c":99.62,"v":1947300},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":99.57,"h":99.79,"l":98.76,"c":99.57,"v":1875300